@startuml
title D6 — Surefyre Integration Architecture (v2)

left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 90

rectangle "Surefyre" as S
rectangle "Integration Layer" as I
rectangle "AIM" as A
rectangle "ImageRight" as G
rectangle "Carrier / Rating" as C
rectangle "3rd Party Data" as T
rectangle "Identity & Access" as ID

S --> I : Business event

I --> A : JSON / REST
A ..> I : Status

I --> G : Document metadata
G ..> I : Document ID

I --> C : Quote / Bind
C ..> I : Decision

I --> T : Lookup
T ..> I : Validated data

S --> ID : Authentication
ID ..> S : Token / Session

legend bottom
Solid = outbound request
Dashed = response
Each integration has its own dedicated lane for readability.
endlegend
@enduml